#: ../../source/models/model_abilities/rerank.rst:5
msgid "Rerank"
msgstr "重排序"

#: ../../source/models/model_abilities/rerank.rst:7
msgid "Learn how to use rerank models in Xinference."
msgstr "学习如何在Xinference中使用重新排序模型。"

#: ../../source/models/model_abilities/rerank.rst:11
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "介绍"

#: ../../source/models/model_abilities/rerank.rst:13
msgid ""
"Given a query and a list of documents, Rerank indexes the documents from "
"most to least semantically relevant to the query. Rerank models in "
"Xinference can be invoked through the Rerank endpoint to rank a list of "
"documents."
msgstr "给定一个查询和一系列文档，Rerank 会根据与查询的语义相关性从最相关到最不相关对文档进行重新排序。"
"在 Xinference 中，可以通过 Rerank 端点调用 Rerank 模型来对一系列文档进行排序。"

#: ../../source/models/model_abilities/rerank.rst:18
msgid "Quickstart"
msgstr "快速入门"

#: ../../source/models/model_abilities/rerank.rst:20
msgid ""
"We can try Rerank API out either via cURL, OpenAI Client, or Xinference's"
" python client:"
msgstr "我们可以通过cURL、OpenAI Client或Xinference的来尝试使用Rerank API："

#: ../../source/models/model_abilities/rerank.rst:107
msgid "Multimodal reranking with Nemotron-3.5-Rerank-8B"
msgstr "使用 Nemotron-3.5-Rerank-8B 进行多模态重排序"

#: ../../source/models/model_abilities/rerank.rst:109
msgid ""
"``Nemotron-3.5-Rerank-8B`` scores text queries against text documents, "
"single images, or combined image-text documents. Its context limit is "
"32,768 tokens, including image tokens. Scores are raw relevance logits; "
"higher is better. Image queries, video, and multiple images in one "
"document are unsupported."
msgstr ""
"``Nemotron-3.5-Rerank-8B`` 根据文本查询，对纯文本文档、单张图片或图文混合文档进行相关性评分。上下文上限为 32,768"
" 个 token，包含图片 token。评分是原始相关性 logits，分数越高表示越相关。模型不支持图片查询、视频或在同一文档中使用多张图片。"

#: ../../source/models/model_abilities/rerank.rst:114
msgid ""
"Launch with one of ``sentence_transformers``, ``transformers``, or "
"``vllm``::"
msgstr "使用 ``sentence_transformers``、 ``transformers`` 或 ``vllm`` 启动模型 ::"

#: ../../source/models/model_abilities/rerank.rst:119
msgid ""
"The model virtualenv settings pin the validated backend versions: "
"``sentence-transformers[image]==6.1.0`` with ``transformers==5.20.0`` for"
" Sentence Transformers, ``transformers==5.20.0`` for native Transformers,"
" and ``vllm==0.32.0`` with ``transformers==5.19.0`` for vLLM. Use "
"separate virtual environments for these backends. Model virtualenv "
"settings install their respective dependencies automatically."
msgstr ""
"模型的虚拟环境配置会固定经过验证的后端版本。Sentence Transformers 使用 ``sentence-"
"transformers[image]==6.1.0`` 和 ``transformers==5.20.0``，原生 Transformers "
"使用 ``transformers==5.20.0``，vLLM 使用 ``vllm==0.32.0`` 和 "
"``transformers==5.19.0``。请为各后端使用独立的虚拟环境。模型会根据虚拟环境配置自动安装相应依赖。"

#: ../../source/models/model_abilities/rerank.rst:126
msgid ""
"Hugging Face uses ``nvidia/Nemotron-3.5-Rerank-8B-BF16`` at revision "
"``main``; ModelScope uses ``nv-community/Nemotron-3.5-Rerank-8B-BF16`` at"
" revision ``master``. Select the download hub with ``--download_hub "
"huggingface`` or ``--download_hub modelscope`` when launching."
msgstr ""
"Hugging Face 使用 ``nvidia/Nemotron-3.5-Rerank-8B-BF16`` 的 ``main`` "
"修订版本。ModelScope 使用 ``nv-community/Nemotron-3.5-Rerank-8B-BF16`` 的 "
"``master`` 修订版本。启动时可用 ``--download_hub huggingface`` 或 ``--download_hub "
"modelscope`` 选择下载源。"

#: ../../source/models/model_abilities/rerank.rst:131
msgid "Use the returned model UID in the standard rerank endpoint::"
msgstr "向标准重排序端点传入返回的模型 UID ::"

#: ../../source/models/model_abilities/rerank.rst:147
msgid ""
"Images can be HTTP(S) URLs or base64 data URLs. OpenAI-style content "
"dictionaries with ``text`` and ``image_url`` blocks are also accepted. "
"HTTP(S) downloads follow Xinference's media policy, including redirect "
"checks, a timeout, and a size limit. Private addresses are blocked by "
"default. Returned documents retain their original input structure. The "
"vLLM adapter renders the checkpoint's query/document template and uses "
"classification pooling, preserving its image placeholders and raw logits."
msgstr ""
"图片可以使用 HTTP(S) URL 或 Base64 数据 URL，也接受包含 ``text`` 和 ``image_url`` 内容块的 "
"OpenAI 格式字典。HTTP(S) 下载遵循 Xinference "
"的媒体策略，包括重定向检查、超时和大小限制。默认会阻止访问私有地址。返回的文档保留原始输入结构。vLLM "
"适配器渲染模型检查点中的查询和文档模板，使用分类池化，并保留图片占位符和原始 logits。"

#: ../../source/models/model_abilities/rerank.rst:155
msgid ""
"See the `official model card <https://huggingface.co/nvidia/Nemotron-3.5"
"-Rerank-8B-BF16>`_ for runtime examples."
msgstr ""
"运行示例见 `官方模型卡 <https://huggingface.co/nvidia/Nemotron-3.5-Rerank-8B-"
"BF16>`_。"
